# Demonic Junker: "Affinity for artifacts" and "When this Vehicle enters, for each player, destroy up to one target creature that
# player controls. If a creature you controlled was destroyed this way, put two +1/+1 counters on this Vehicle." Bot1 controls
# Mox Jet and Memnite (two artifacts once Black Lotus is sacrificed for mana, so the Junker costs {4}{B}): Lotus and Jet make four, one
# short (the refusal), and a Swamp pays exactly. Its slot for Bot1 takes Bot1's own Memnite (a creature Bot2 controls is refused there), the slot for
# Bot2 takes Bot2's Ornithopter (Bot2's Mox Pearl, no creature, is refused). Both die together and the Junker gets two counters.

